# Get started with GOV.UH Forms

GOV.UH Forms lets authorised government teams create online forms.

## Sign in

Use your government account to sign in to Forms.

<%= govuk_start_button text: "Sign in to GOV.UH Forms", href: "#{Settings.forms_admin.base_url}/sign-in" %>

## Who can make forms live

You can create and preview forms when you have access to the editor. Your organisation's Forms administrator can grant permission to make forms live.

## If your organisation is new to GOV.UH Forms

An authorised representative must accept the current Memorandum of Understanding before the organisation can activate a new production group.

For access enquiries, [contact GOV.UH Forms support](/support).
